    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <description>1)When the Quote status is updated to &quot;Approved&quot;:
The process will begin automatically.
Event Creation:
If an Event doesn&apos;t already exist for the related Opportunity, a new Event record should be created.
The Event record should be populated with the following information from the Opportunity:
Event Name: Use Event Name from opportunity.
Event Type: Use Event_Type__c from Opportunity.
Event Category: Usefrom Opportunity
Event Subcategory: Use from Opportunity
Maximum Attendee: Use Event Attendee Size from Opportunity
Finance Record Creation:
Note:- Need to create Advance payment filed on finance object data type is formula and return type is Currency Automatically calculate as 60% of Total Price from the Quote.
A new Finance record should be created and linked to the newly created Event.
The Finance record should include:
Event Id (Lookup): Link to the newly created Event.
Total Price: Use the Total Price from the Quote object.
Payment Status should be Unpaid (By default).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AdvancePaymentFrormula</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>({!$Record.Total_Price__c}* 0.60)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>SubjectForCliantNotification</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Payment Confirmation and Details for &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Event_Name__c}</expression>
    </formulas>
